WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:05.766
- Can't wait till they finish it.
- It's so great.

2
00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:07.533
Check out that pool.

3
00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:14.266
With the fierce battle against Team Flare behind them,

4
00:00:14.333 --> 00:00:17.966
our heroes are now working hard to reopen the Lumiose Gym.

5
00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:21.200
Chu!

6
00:00:21.266 --> 00:00:22.733
Okay, that's enough.

7
00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:24.433
Thanks, Pikachu.

8
00:00:25.566 --> 00:00:26.766
Pika, Pika.

9
00:00:27.566 --> 00:00:29.333
Now, let's take a break.

10
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.366
Thanks a lot.

11
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.833
Are you feeling better now?

12
00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:34.200
I'm fine.

13
00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:37.266
After all, this guy's made out of bricks.

14
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.766
Just a little bit more.

15
00:00:39.833 --> 00:00:44.466
Right. All we have left is a final check. We'll be up and running tomorrow.

16
00:00:47.133 --> 00:00:50.333
- Clemont's gonna be so glad.
- Pika, Pika.

17
00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:56.200
All right, how about this?

18
00:01:00.766 --> 00:01:02.633
Initializing program.

19
00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:05.700
Hi. My name is Clembot. Nice to meet you.

20
00:01:08.366 --> 00:01:10.600
I'm Clemont. I created you.

21
00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:12.633
The pleasure is all mine.

22
00:01:13.366 --> 00:01:14.966
Clemont. Hello.

23
00:01:17.366 --> 00:01:22.200
So, news of Team Flare's untimely demise has reached headquarters.

24
00:01:22.266 --> 00:01:24.466
One fact is not widely known.

25
00:01:24.533 --> 00:01:27.200
You see, the successful execution of our plan

26
00:01:27.266 --> 00:01:30.066
had a huge hand in Team Flare's ultimate downfall.

27
00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.800
Well, I look forward to your report.

28
00:01:32.866 --> 00:01:35.366
As soon as the Lumiose Airport reopens,

29
00:01:35.433 --> 00:01:38.300
we'll be winging it back to headquarters ASAP.

30
00:01:38.366 --> 00:01:41.233
Good. I will be expecting you.

31
00:01:43.733 --> 00:01:45.000
You hear that?

32
00:01:45.066 --> 00:01:47.600
Hard work and trouble really does pay off.

33
00:01:47.666 --> 00:01:51.033
Our Kalos toiling has allowed us to grab the brass ring.

34
00:01:51.466 --> 00:01:54.600
Ka-ching! Ring-a-ding-ding!

35
00:01:54.666 --> 00:01:57.866
- Hmm. There's something lacking.
- Huh?

36
00:01:57.933 --> 00:02:01.233
Some sort of surprise that'll really blow the boss away.

37
00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:05.466
Good point. Now, if we were to gift the twerp's Pikachu as a bonus...

38
00:02:05.533 --> 00:02:07.900
We'll make our new home in Happy Land.

39
00:02:07.966 --> 00:02:10.900
The boss will have Pikachu, and we'll have dough.

40
00:02:10.966 --> 00:02:13.166
A-catching we will go!

41
00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:16.500
- Inkay, Inkay!
- Wobbuffet!

42
00:02:21.966 --> 00:02:25.266
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

43
00:02:26.033 --> 00:02:29.200
♪ Knock me down I'll just get up again ♪

44
00:02:29.733 --> 00:02:33.100
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

45
00:02:33.166 --> 00:02:35.766
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

46
00:02:36.366 --> 00:02:37.500
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

47
00:02:37.566 --> 00:02:40.666
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

48
00:02:40.733 --> 00:02:43.900
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

49
00:02:43.966 --> 00:02:45.633
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

50
00:02:56.866 --> 00:02:59.433
I see. So, it didn't work.

51
00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:01.666
- I'm sorry.
- Dedenne.

52
00:03:02.433 --> 00:03:06.600
I'm afraid the data's completely lost. It's impossible to get back.

53
00:03:08.033 --> 00:03:09.833
- Hello. Excuse me.
- Huh?

54
00:03:10.566 --> 00:03:12.833
I came to challenge the Lumiose Gym.

55
00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:15.100
It's you.

56
00:03:15.166 --> 00:03:16.700
You're-- You're Ash.

57
00:03:16.766 --> 00:03:17.600
- Huh?
- Pika?

58
00:03:17.666 --> 00:03:20.600
The Kalos League finals were the most amazing ever.

59
00:03:20.666 --> 00:03:22.333
You saw them, huh?

60
00:03:22.833 --> 00:03:25.600
You were so cool. I got so into it.

61
00:03:25.666 --> 00:03:28.566
That's why I wanna battle in the Kalos League.

62
00:03:28.633 --> 00:03:29.900
A battle, then.

63
00:03:29.966 --> 00:03:33.066
My name's Clemont, and I'm the Lumiose Gym Leader.

64
00:03:33.133 --> 00:03:35.200
Uh... Uh...

65
00:03:35.266 --> 00:03:37.533
Wait. Where's Clembot?

66
00:03:39.366 --> 00:03:41.066
So, that's what happened.

67
00:03:41.133 --> 00:03:42.566
Okay. I see.

68
00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:45.933
A while back, I challenged this gym,

69
00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.466
but Clembot beat me badly.

70
00:03:49.633 --> 00:03:51.866
I was so upset.

71
00:03:52.233 --> 00:03:56.466
I knew I wanted to battle Clembot again and win that badge,

72
00:03:56.533 --> 00:03:58.966
so, I've been training hard ever since.

73
00:03:59.033 --> 00:04:00.766
I know just how you feel.

74
00:04:00.833 --> 00:04:05.000
Trainers and Pokémon work really hard because they've just gotta win.

75
00:04:05.066 --> 00:04:06.266
Pikachu.

76
00:04:06.333 --> 00:04:08.433
So, then, what will you do?

77
00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:10.200
- Dedenne?
- Hmm.

78
00:04:10.833 --> 00:04:14.200
Clembot can battle, but it's back to its default memory,

79
00:04:14.266 --> 00:04:17.233
so, it won't remember anything from before. Sorry.

80
00:04:17.833 --> 00:04:20.399
I don't care. I wanna battle Clembot.

81
00:04:20.466 --> 00:04:22.100
Can I? Please?

82
00:04:22.866 --> 00:04:24.833
Uh... I understand.

83
00:04:25.666 --> 00:04:26.500
One thing.

84
00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:31.466
The battlefield isn't ready. I hope you'll be able to come back tomorrow.

85
00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:34.466
In the meantime, I'll give Clembot some final tweaks.

86
00:04:34.533 --> 00:04:36.233
Hmm! Great.

87
00:04:38.366 --> 00:04:39.933
Thank you so much.

88
00:04:41.466 --> 00:04:42.566
See you tomorrow.

89
00:04:42.633 --> 00:04:44.133
Yeah. Bye-bye.

90
00:04:44.633 --> 00:04:47.933
Excuse me, Ash. Professor Sycamore just called.

91
00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:50.433
Alain's going to be coming back today.

92
00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:51.966
Wow! Awesome.

93
00:04:52.033 --> 00:04:53.433
- Pika!
- Ah!

94
00:04:59.033 --> 00:05:00.866
Huh? Aah!

95
00:05:00.933 --> 00:05:03.333
-Chespin, Che!

96
00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:04.400
Hey, you guys.

97
00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:07.433
Ash, what are you doing here?

98
00:05:07.533 --> 00:05:08.566
What happened?

99
00:05:09.133 --> 00:05:10.566
Well, see...

100
00:05:10.633 --> 00:05:11.833
I can guess.

101
00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:15.233
Alain's coming home, so, I thought we'd have a little party.

102
00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:17.200
- Oh.
- Pika.

103
00:05:18.433 --> 00:05:20.666
It smells like something's burning.

104
00:05:20.733 --> 00:05:22.100
Burning?! No!

105
00:05:23.166 --> 00:05:24.700
Totally ruined.

106
00:05:24.766 --> 00:05:26.666
It's my specialty.

107
00:05:26.733 --> 00:05:27.700
Aw.

108
00:05:28.166 --> 00:05:31.166
I've got it. Mairin, any ingredients left?

109
00:05:31.233 --> 00:05:32.366
Huh?

110
00:05:32.433 --> 00:05:36.266
We can make it work out. I'll help. We'll make it great.

111
00:05:36.333 --> 00:05:37.733
I can help, too.

112
00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:41.033
- And we'll all get it done in time.
- Pikachu.

113
00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:44.100
- I wanna decorate, okay?
- Dedenne.

114
00:05:44.166 --> 00:05:45.600
Hey, thanks, everyone.

115
00:05:45.666 --> 00:05:47.066
Chespin, Che.

116
00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:52.633
- Glad you're back. Have you been busy?
- Yeah.

117
00:06:09.566 --> 00:06:12.100
I wonder what Squishy's doing.

118
00:06:18.633 --> 00:06:20.866
Don't worry. Squishy's fine.

119
00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:22.766
Pikachu.

120
00:06:22.833 --> 00:06:26.066
Yeah, you're right. It's probably lying in the sun.

121
00:06:26.133 --> 00:06:28.066
- Dedenne.
- Pika, Pika.

122
00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:32.100
- Tada! Finished.
- Looks so good.

123
00:06:34.233 --> 00:06:35.800
- We're back.
- Huh?

124
00:06:35.866 --> 00:06:37.433
- Professor!
- Here.

125
00:06:38.666 --> 00:06:39.733
Huh?

126
00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:45.266
Welcome home, Alain.

127
00:06:45.333 --> 00:06:49.266
We're having a little party to welcome you back. Everyone helped.

128
00:06:49.333 --> 00:06:51.566
- We've been waiting.
- Pika!

129
00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.100
Let's eat before it all gets cold.

130
00:06:54.633 --> 00:06:56.233
I'll go make some tea.

131
00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:58.433
Not bad, huh?

132
00:07:04.466 --> 00:07:06.400
This is so tasty. Wow.

133
00:07:24.366 --> 00:07:26.333
Here, try this one, Alain.

134
00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:31.733
Like it? Is it good?

135
00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:33.166
Yeah.

136
00:07:33.233 --> 00:07:34.733
I'm so glad.

137
00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:37.000
So, the Lumiose Gym is reopening.

138
00:07:37.066 --> 00:07:39.333
There's already a challenger waiting.

139
00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.066
- Right?
- Uh, yeah.

140
00:07:41.133 --> 00:07:43.500
Tell me about your plans from here on out.

141
00:07:43.566 --> 00:07:44.766
Huh?

142
00:07:44.833 --> 00:07:47.066
I'm thinking of going back to Kanto.

143
00:07:47.133 --> 00:07:51.933
Back to Pallet Town to start over. I mean, completely, like start from the ground up.

144
00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:53.066
Pikachu.

145
00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.033
- Ground up?
- Uh-huh.

146
00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:57.300
There are so many strong trainers.

147
00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:59.133
I'll begin again.

148
00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:01.900
That sounds like something you'd do.

149
00:08:01.966 --> 00:08:03.966
- Huh?

150
00:08:07.066 --> 00:08:08.500
Not again.

151
00:08:08.566 --> 00:08:11.633
- Why do you eat so much?
- Let's get Chespin to bed.

152
00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:13.266
- You okay?
- Oh, Chespin.

153
00:08:24.866 --> 00:08:25.866
Good to see you.

154
00:08:27.533 --> 00:08:30.300
It's been a while since you've seen them, huh?

155
00:08:31.433 --> 00:08:32.966
Hmm. Yeah.

156
00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:35.066
So, what about you?

157
00:08:35.633 --> 00:08:36.866
What are your plans?

158
00:08:38.233 --> 00:08:39.733
I'm not really sure.

159
00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:41.700
Oh, I see.

160
00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:45.833
I didn't mean to, but I helped Lysandre with his plan,

161
00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:47.233
whether I knew it or not.

162
00:08:48.566 --> 00:08:49.466
Oh.

163
00:08:49.533 --> 00:08:52.433
I caused trouble for a lot of people and Pokémon.

164
00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:54.666
I made so many mistakes.

165
00:08:55.433 --> 00:08:56.400
Alain...

166
00:08:57.066 --> 00:08:59.633
I can't even begin to make up for them all.

167
00:09:01.433 --> 00:09:03.633
I don't know much about that, but...

168
00:09:06.566 --> 00:09:09.000
I do know that battling you was a blast.

169
00:09:09.066 --> 00:09:10.133
Huh?

170
00:09:10.566 --> 00:09:13.533
I got so pumped up and excited during the finals.

171
00:09:15.033 --> 00:09:17.866
I'm sure my Pokémon felt the same way, too.

172
00:09:18.366 --> 00:09:19.433
Thanks, Ash.

173
00:09:19.966 --> 00:09:21.966
That's it, I guess.

174
00:09:22.733 --> 00:09:26.333
Just promise me one thing. That you'll battle me again.

175
00:09:28.133 --> 00:09:29.800
- Hmm?
- Again?

176
00:09:30.833 --> 00:09:34.633
You're always helping me out, and you did it again.

177
00:09:35.066 --> 00:09:38.900
I guess I never really could win once and for all. It's a deal.

178
00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:41.300
We'll battle again.

179
00:09:41.366 --> 00:09:42.800
- Huh?

180
00:09:42.866 --> 00:09:44.566
Pika!

181
00:09:44.633 --> 00:09:45.966
Pikachu!

182
00:09:46.433 --> 00:09:48.566
Who's that Pokémon?

183
00:09:53.033 --> 00:09:54.866
It's Psyduck.

184
00:09:54.933 --> 00:09:56.233
Psyduck.

185
00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:00.300
What happened?

186
00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.833
They stole Pikachu.

187
00:10:06.566 --> 00:10:07.533
Pika, Pi!

188
00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:10.100
Team Rocket, when are you gonna stop?!

189
00:10:10.166 --> 00:10:12.600
Prepare for trouble. Never, young twerp.

190
00:10:12.666 --> 00:10:15.100
Make it double. You're the duke of derp.

191
00:10:15.166 --> 00:10:19.966
- To protect the world from devastation.
- To unite all people within our nation.

192
00:10:20.033 --> 00:10:22.866
So, now that the planet is back on its feet...

193
00:10:22.933 --> 00:10:25.666
We're back on the Pikachu burglary beat.

194
00:10:26.466 --> 00:10:28.666
- Jessie.
- And James.

195
00:10:28.733 --> 00:10:31.466
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light.

196
00:10:31.533 --> 00:10:34.566
Surrender now or prepare for a newsworthy fight.

197
00:10:34.633 --> 00:10:36.100
Meowth, that's right.

198
00:10:36.166 --> 00:10:38.000
Wobbuffet.

199
00:10:39.466 --> 00:10:41.900
You had better let Pikachu go, or else!

200
00:10:41.966 --> 00:10:43.466
Or else? Or else what?

201
00:10:43.533 --> 00:10:46.966
Are you going to tell us how marvelous everything is until we give up?

202
00:10:47.033 --> 00:10:50.233
This prized Pikachu has a one-way ticket to the boss.

203
00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:51.900
Wobbuffet.

204
00:10:51.966 --> 00:10:53.433
Oh, no, you don't.

205
00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.466
Now, Greninja, water shuriken.

206
00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:57.733
Greninja!

207
00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.200
Gourgeist, shadow ball.

208
00:10:59.266 --> 00:11:01.133
Okay, Inkay, use psybeam.

209
00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:04.300
- Gourgeist.
- Inkay!

210
00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:09.100
Second act? seed bomb.

211
00:11:09.166 --> 00:11:11.233
Charizard, use flamethrower.

212
00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.900
That smoke's bad for my lungs.

213
00:11:18.966 --> 00:11:21.333
- Vacuum them up with vim.
- And vigor.

214
00:11:22.533 --> 00:11:25.733
Greninja, use cut and destroy their machine.

215
00:11:26.133 --> 00:11:28.233
Greninja!

216
00:11:30.566 --> 00:11:33.233
- You okay, buddy?
- Pikachu.

217
00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:35.000
All right, cut the comedy.

218
00:11:35.066 --> 00:11:36.933
- Now, dark pulse.
- Use psybeam.

219
00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.500
Braixen, flamethrower.

220
00:11:39.566 --> 00:11:42.566
- Chespin, use pin missile.
- Chespin!

221
00:11:44.366 --> 00:11:46.000
Pikachu, thunderbolt, go.

222
00:11:46.066 --> 00:11:48.600
Pikachu!

223
00:11:48.666 --> 00:11:50.466
Charizard, flamethrower.

224
00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:58.533
In our defense, please, let's not forget those two were Kalos League finalists.

225
00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:01.866
I wagered the twerp and the big guy for the win.

226
00:12:01.933 --> 00:12:06.733
Pikachu is still a great homecoming gift. Gotta fly for now, but we'll be back!

227
00:12:07.166 --> 00:12:09.133
We're blasting off again!

228
00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:10.333
Wobbuffet!

229
00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:12.066
- Inkay!
- Gourgeist!

230
00:12:13.666 --> 00:12:15.700
Alain, you're incredible.

231
00:12:16.133 --> 00:12:17.433
You, too, Ash.

232
00:12:18.633 --> 00:12:19.700
Oh, well.

233
00:12:20.333 --> 00:12:22.266
I'll go and get my tools.

234
00:12:27.366 --> 00:12:29.800
Just think. It's your first battle.

235
00:12:30.366 --> 00:12:31.633
Let's do it.

236
00:12:33.233 --> 00:12:35.933
The Lumiose Gym battle between Clembot,

237
00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.266
the substitute gym leader,

238
00:12:37.333 --> 00:12:39.900
and Alvin, the challenger, will now begin.

239
00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:44.000
Each trainer will have three Pokémon. The battle is over

240
00:12:44.066 --> 00:12:47.400
when all Pokémon on either side are unable to continue.

241
00:12:47.466 --> 00:12:50.366
- Clembot, you ready?
- Yes, sir.

242
00:12:50.433 --> 00:12:52.466
My first Pokémon is Magnemite.

243
00:12:54.433 --> 00:12:56.366
Vivillon, today we win.

244
00:12:57.700 --> 00:12:58.866
Vivillon.

245
00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:01.966
I wonder what they'll do. Can't wait to see.

246
00:13:02.033 --> 00:13:02.933
Pika, Pika.

247
00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:05.300
All right, battle begin!

248
00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:11.766
Bug and Flying types are weak against Electric-type moves.

249
00:13:11.833 --> 00:13:13.433
Use electro ball.

250
00:13:14.733 --> 00:13:17.666
All right. Vivillon, flash.

251
00:13:19.066 --> 00:13:21.366
-Quiver dance, now.

252
00:13:25.333 --> 00:13:28.566
- What's my next move?
- Stay calm. Focus and observe.

253
00:13:28.633 --> 00:13:31.800
Predict your opponent's next move and give precise commands.

254
00:13:31.866 --> 00:13:34.200
Observe, sir? Then predict?

255
00:13:34.966 --> 00:13:37.000
Vivillon, use stun spore.

256
00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:38.933
Magnemite.

257
00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.500
All right. Use energy ball.

258
00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.100
Magnemite!

259
00:13:47.400 --> 00:13:50.433
Magnemite is unable to battle. Vivillon's the winner.

260
00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:51.333
Yes!

261
00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:54.966
Vivillon completely paralyzed its opponent with stun spore.

262
00:13:55.033 --> 00:13:58.033
They attacked without missing a beat. He's awesome.

263
00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:00.500
- Pika.
- Magnemite, return.

264
00:14:01.466 --> 00:14:04.533
Listen, Clembot. You can't get nervous.

265
00:14:04.600 --> 00:14:07.100
- Eyes open at all times.
- Right.

266
00:14:07.566 --> 00:14:10.133
Watch me win this time. Magneton.

267
00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:11.700
Magneton.

268
00:14:11.766 --> 00:14:14.166
- Vivillon, use stun spore.
- Vivillon!

269
00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:19.400
- Use rain dance.
- Magneton.

270
00:14:22.933 --> 00:14:25.900
- Magneton, use Thunder.
- Magneton.

271
00:14:28.166 --> 00:14:29.033
Vivillon!

272
00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:34.533
Vivillon is unable to battle. Magneton wins.

273
00:14:34.966 --> 00:14:37.666
You slowed up its movement and attacked using thunder.

274
00:14:37.733 --> 00:14:39.766
Good. Excellent strategy.

275
00:14:41.033 --> 00:14:44.500
Because I observed, predicted, then formed a plan.

276
00:14:44.566 --> 00:14:46.000
Watch me win again.

277
00:14:46.066 --> 00:14:47.400
Use flamethrower.

278
00:14:47.833 --> 00:14:49.166
Use thunder.

279
00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:54.533
Pyroar is unable to battle. Magneton's the winner.

280
00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:55.900
We did it, sir.

281
00:14:55.966 --> 00:14:58.400
Clembot? Doesn't it feel good to win?

282
00:14:58.466 --> 00:14:59.633
Yes.

283
00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:01.433
My last Pokémon.

284
00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:02.800
Cubone, go!

285
00:15:04.366 --> 00:15:05.633
Cubone.

286
00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:09.233
Ground type. Electric-type moves? They have no effect.

287
00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:12.666
Weak against Water types. Magneton is at a disadvantage.

288
00:15:12.733 --> 00:15:15.033
Cubone, bonemerang!

289
00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.066
Cubone. Cubone!

290
00:15:17.133 --> 00:15:19.600
- Magneton, sonic boom.
- Magneton.

291
00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.300
Cubone, brick break, go!

292
00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:33.333
Magneton is unable to battle. Cubone's the winner.

293
00:15:33.766 --> 00:15:35.500
- Cubone.
- All right!

294
00:15:36.766 --> 00:15:38.700
All right, Magneton, return.

295
00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:41.733
It's upsetting to lose.

296
00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:45.233
But losing is how you learn to become stronger.

297
00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:47.000
Use the experience.

298
00:15:47.466 --> 00:15:49.800
- It's not over, you know.
- Yes, sir.

299
00:15:50.233 --> 00:15:52.833
Now, Heliolisk, I need your help.

300
00:15:55.133 --> 00:15:56.266
Helio!

301
00:15:56.333 --> 00:15:58.566
That badge is mine, no matter what.

302
00:15:58.633 --> 00:16:00.866
- Cubone, brick break.
- Cubone.

303
00:16:00.933 --> 00:16:02.100
Dodge it, Heliolisk.

304
00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:07.366
Electric-type moves won't work.

305
00:16:07.433 --> 00:16:09.666
Instead, dragon tail.

306
00:16:09.733 --> 00:16:11.600
Heliolisk!

307
00:16:11.666 --> 00:16:12.566
Block!

308
00:16:15.866 --> 00:16:17.366
Use bone rush.

309
00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:21.200
Use focus blast.

310
00:16:21.266 --> 00:16:24.466
-Cubone!

311
00:16:25.533 --> 00:16:26.800
Success.

312
00:16:29.633 --> 00:16:32.533
All right. No, we're never giving up.

313
00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:36.600
I'm sure we're going to beat Clembot. Clembot taught us a lot.

314
00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:40.233
All Pokémon possess infinite possibilities.

315
00:16:40.666 --> 00:16:42.200
And tapping into them?

316
00:16:43.066 --> 00:16:45.033
That's a trainer's duty.

317
00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:46.200
Huh?

318
00:16:46.266 --> 00:16:50.333
Your words inspired me to train really hard ever since.

319
00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:51.366
My words?

320
00:16:51.433 --> 00:16:53.533
Cubone, use bonemerang.

321
00:16:55.333 --> 00:16:57.333
Focus blast, one more time.

322
00:17:05.533 --> 00:17:08.599
Heliolisk is unable to battle. Cubone's the winner.

323
00:17:08.666 --> 00:17:11.966
Which means the victor is... Alvin, the challenger.

324
00:17:12.033 --> 00:17:15.066
All right! We did it! Yay!

325
00:17:15.133 --> 00:17:18.099
- Cubone, you were great. Thanks.
- Cubone!

326
00:17:23.233 --> 00:17:25.700
Having a Pokémon battle is lots of fun.

327
00:17:26.533 --> 00:17:28.133
Most enjoyable.

328
00:17:28.533 --> 00:17:29.366
Good.

329
00:17:32.666 --> 00:17:33.833
Give him this.

330
00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:35.366
Congratulations, Alvin.

331
00:17:35.433 --> 00:17:37.200
Here is your Voltage Badge.

332
00:17:38.733 --> 00:17:40.966
Thanks a lot. Wow.

333
00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:45.533
- Good for you, Alvin.
- Thanks.

334
00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:47.466
You battled well, Clembot.

335
00:17:47.533 --> 00:17:51.433
Magnemite, Magneton and Heliolisk, they were great, too.

336
00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:54.300
Yes. Thank you all for cheering for us.

337
00:17:55.266 --> 00:17:57.900
I want to learn a lot more about Pokémon

338
00:17:57.966 --> 00:18:00.900
to learn more about drawing out a Pokémon's power.

339
00:18:01.333 --> 00:18:03.566
Won't you teach me? Please, Clemont.

340
00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.233
I'd love to.

341
00:18:08.566 --> 00:18:10.566
Let's grow together, deal?

342
00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:13.100
It's a deal.

343
00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:18.966
All right, now that we're gathered here together...

344
00:18:19.366 --> 00:18:21.300
it's Kalos League award time.

345
00:18:21.733 --> 00:18:24.300
- Award time?
- Huh? Right.

346
00:18:24.366 --> 00:18:27.800
It never happened because of the horrible things Team Flare was doing.

347
00:18:27.866 --> 00:18:31.333
You're right. So, let's award Ash and Alain right here.

348
00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:34.800
- I know. Let's award everyone.
- Everyone?

349
00:18:34.866 --> 00:18:39.200
Yeah. 'Cause we all battled Team Flare, right? That's why.

350
00:18:39.266 --> 00:18:41.866
- Dedenne.
- A great idea, Bonnie.

351
00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:50.966
This is to celebrate our talented trainers and their Pokémon.

352
00:18:51.033 --> 00:18:53.600
Congratulations on second place.

353
00:18:53.666 --> 00:18:55.466
This is awesome. Thanks.

354
00:18:56.633 --> 00:18:57.533
Pikachu.

355
00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:00.100
Congratulations, Alain.

356
00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:05.000
Alain, I'm wondering, would you consider helping me out again with my research?

357
00:19:05.066 --> 00:19:08.966
- Uh, but I can't.
- I could use your assistance.

358
00:19:09.066 --> 00:19:10.833
And Lumiose sure could, too.

359
00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:12.533
We all could.

360
00:19:16.133 --> 00:19:16.966
All right.

361
00:19:17.766 --> 00:19:19.366
Yeah. That's great.

362
00:19:19.966 --> 00:19:20.900
Hmm.

363
00:19:36.633 --> 00:19:40.900
Ten, nine, eight, seven,

364
00:19:40.966 --> 00:19:46.133
- six, five, four, three...
- Today is a day for celebration.

365
00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:48.600
- ..two, one.
- Let's celebrate with a bang.

366
00:19:58.033 --> 00:19:59.500
-Pika!

367
00:19:59.566 --> 00:20:00.966
- Electricity's cool.
- Yay!

368
00:20:01.033 --> 00:20:04.466
- It's so pretty.
- That signals the Lumiose Gym is back.

369
00:20:04.533 --> 00:20:08.000
I'm gonna shine like Prism Tower. Like the brightest star.

370
00:20:08.066 --> 00:20:10.466
- What do you say, buddy?
- Pikachu.

371
00:20:10.533 --> 00:20:12.466
- Me, too.
- Dedenne.

372
00:20:12.533 --> 00:20:15.700
Serena, you haven't told us what your plans are yet.

373
00:20:16.600 --> 00:20:18.500
I'm really not quite sure.

374
00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:22.666
Would you like to learn with me?

375
00:20:25.633 --> 00:20:28.000
- You'll be just fine, Serena.
- Huh?

376
00:20:28.433 --> 00:20:29.666
I believe in you.

377
00:20:30.166 --> 00:20:31.233
Pika, Pika.

378
00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:32.866
Wow.

379
00:20:32.933 --> 00:20:34.133
Thank you, Ash.

380
00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:39.066
Surrounded by the bright lights and glittering splendor

381
00:20:39.133 --> 00:20:40.966
of the newly repaired Prism Tower,

382
00:20:41.033 --> 00:20:44.400
each of our heroes has made a decision for their future,

383
00:20:44.466 --> 00:20:46.600
as the journey continues.
